# IO and platform (maintainer)

Read **`packages/io/ARCHITECTURE.md`** before changing sequencing, storage delivery, snapshots, or the hosted facet path.

## Topologies

- **In-process:** `IORoom` + `manageSessions(room)` in one isolate (`platform-node`, Cloudflare without facets).
- **Hosted:** Sockets and `RoomSessionManager` on the supervisor DO (`packages/cli/src/room/supervisor.ts`). Document and treaty on the **user facet** (`RoomFacet`). `SessionRoom["~"]` is the only room entry point from the session manager.

## Three handler outcomes

`RoomEffects` (send now) · `DeferredResult` (in-process, step off `SerialQueue`) · `{ $suspended: true }` (hosted; deliver via retained `RpcTarget`).

## `$storageUpdated`

Pending list on the room. **`writeFrames`** = sockets only (hosted delivery). **`applyFrames`** = write + `dropStorageUpdates`. Retries and `_unsent` omit `$storageUpdated`; snapshot loop sends them.

## Architecture narrative (source of truth)

Read MDX on your checkout: `apps/docs/content/docs/architecture/`. Prefer that over docs.pluv.io when behavior must match the branch you are on.
